    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust's compiler team are responsible for maintaining the Rust compiler, improving its performance and considering the stabilization of compiler features.",
      "source_hash": 6680668574592706627,
      "context_hash": 5942059920935948000,
      "translation": "Rust의 컴파일러 팀은 Rust 컴파일러를 유지 관리하고, 성능을 개선하며, 컴파일러 기능의 안정화를 검토하는 일을 담당합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler team": "컴파일러 팀",
        "Rust": "Rust",
        "stabilization": "안정화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:57.511299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "We use the Forge to document the team's processes, policies, and working practices.",
      "source_hash": 836187619500924109,
      "context_hash": 6530212432929012582,
      "translation": "저희는 Forge를 사용하여 팀의 프로세스, 정책, 작업 관행을 문서화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:33.049335Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "If you'd like to read about how the compiler works and instructions on how to set up a development environment, you're looking for the [rustc-dev-guide](https://rustc-dev-guide.rust-lang.org/).",
      "source_hash": 3550383953400983350,
      "context_hash": 1620536465967309273,
      "translation": "컴파일러가 어떻게 동작하는지, 그리고 개발 환경을 설정하는 방법에 대해 읽어보고 싶으시다면, 찾으시는 것은 [rustc-dev-guide](https://rustc-dev-guide.rust-lang.org/)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "rustc": "rustc"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:57.511301Z",
      "issues": []
    },
